msgid "“%1” already exists here"
msgstr "「%1」は既にここにあります"

#: synfiles.qml:4003
msgid "• …and %1 more"
msgid_plural "• …and %1 more"
msgstr[0] "• …ほか %1 件"

#: synfiles.qml:3922
msgid ""
"⚠ This is %1, which writes changes to new blocks instead of over the old "
"ones, and snapshots keep whole copies. The file will be gone, but its "
"contents may still be recoverable from the disk. Full-disk encryption is "
"what actually prevents that."
msgstr "⚠ これは %1 です。変更を古いブロックに上書きせず新しいブロックへ書き込み、スナップショットが丸ごとの複製を保持します。ファイルは消えますが、中身はディスクから復元できてしまうかもしれません。それを実際に防ぐのはディスク全体の暗号化です。"

#: synfiles.qml:3928
msgid ""
"⚠ This is %1, which writes changes to new blocks instead of over the old "
